  CVE-2018-25240|2026-04-04T14:16:19.453|2026-04-07T13:20:55.200|6.9|MEDIUM|CWE-1260|N/A|false|Watchr 1.1.0.0 contains a denial of service vulnerability that allows local attackers to crash the application by submitting an excessively long string to the search functionality. Attackers can paste a buffer of 8145 characters into the search bar and trigger a search operation to cause the application to crash.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2018-25240|0.00012|0.01698|4.8304
